00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.960
together, in what we call a pod.

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:11.500
And they are tied together on
a high-performance interconnect

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.320
that makes them look
like, to your application,

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.210
it's just one accelerator.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.100
So the only work
you have to do is

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:20.170
to increase your
training batch size

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:24.290
to take advantage of all
this additional hardware.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:28.540
Nik, between v2 and v3,
which one do you like best?

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:32.350
NIKITA SPIRIN: Short answer,
