It's time to get the work done.

00:40:46.530 --> 00:40:47.363
NIKITA SPIRIN: Yeah.

00:40:47.363 --> 00:40:51.350
It seems that we are short on
time, so let's get stuff done.

00:40:51.350 --> 00:40:54.660
And just a small
