00:45:17.370 --> 00:45:19.590
Leopard and jaguar--
and this time,

00:45:19.590 --> 00:45:21.240
in this busy cowboy
scene, it actually

00:45:21.240 --> 00:45:23.775
sees the little dog here.

00:45:23.775 --> 00:45:28.442
And my favorite, it got
