00:45:28.442 --> 00:45:29.400
NIKITA SPIRIN: Design--

00:45:29.400 --> 00:45:29.690
MARTIN GORNER: Tiger.

00:45:29.690 --> 00:45:31.440
NIKITA SPIRIN:
--costumer-centric metrics.

00:45:31.440 --> 00:45:33.240
Make sure that two
